Advantages of Using Pandas
Faster for Small Data: If the dataset isn’t huge (a few million rows), Pandas can handle it efficiently.
In-Memory Processing: Everything is processed in memory, which avoids slow database I/O.
Flexible Analysis: You can use Python libraries like matplotlib and seaborn for visualization.
Tips for Large Files
